        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-900">8. Profile Indicators and Reviews</h2>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">8.1 Profile Indicators</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">BreederHQ may display Profile Indicators on a Service Provider's profile or listings reflecting facts about the Service Provider's account history or representations, including without limitation date of account creation, date of last login, frequency of response to Buyer inquiries, count of completed bookings, count of unresolved disputes, Third-Party Identity Verification Passthrough status under §2.6 of the Terms of Service, and Third-Party Registry Passthrough status under §2.5 of the Terms of Service. <strong>Profile Indicators reflect data; they do not reflect BreederHQ's editorial evaluation, endorsement, ranking, or warranty of the Service Provider.</strong> <strong>BreederHQ shall not label any Profile Indicator, alone or combined with other indicators, with "verified," "vetted," "trusted," "approved," "certified," "endorsed," or similar language characterizing the Service Provider.</strong> A Third-Party Identity Verification Passthrough shows only that, as of the date shown, the Third-Party Identity Verification Provider reported that the individual who completed the Identity Check for the account passed it, as described in §2.6 of the Terms of Service. BreederHQ may begin, modify, or cease displaying any Profile Indicator at any time. The Service Provider has no contractual right to the display, modification, or continuation of any Profile Indicator. Where the underlying fact reflected by an indicator changes, BreederHQ may cease display of the indicator without notice. The Identity Check requirement in §2.5 applies whether or not a Third-Party Identity Verification Passthrough is displayed, and displaying, modifying, or ceasing to display that indicator does not by itself change whether the requirement is met.</p>
