        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Service Provider acknowledges that BreederHQ does not investigate or evaluate the accuracy of any individual Buyer review. Buyer reviews are user-generated content, and BreederHQ reserves every protection available to it under applicable law with respect to such content, which may include protections under 47 U.S.C. §230.</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2 text-gray-900">8.3 Credential Display Discipline</h3>
